# Copy the names, not the values, into Vercel > Settings > Environment Variables.
# Never commit real keys. .env* is already gitignored.
#
# Payments need NO environment variables. Checkout hands the cart to Shopify
# through a plain URL, and the two values it needs -- the store domain and the
# product variant ids -- are public, so they live in src/lib/shopify.ts where a
# missing or misnamed variable cannot silently break them.

# ---- Reviews (unrelated to payments) ----------------------------------------
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REVIEW_ENDPOINT=

# ---- Site ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. Overrides the canonical URL used in metadata and the sitemap.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://glowgummies.org
